246-
247-When DSL can't help — searching for arbitrary text across board files.
248-
249-```bash
250-# Find mentions of a term
251-task-board grep "AudioRecorder"
252-
253-# Search in specific file type
254-task-board grep "blocked.*deployment" --file progress.md
255-
256-# Case-insensitive search in descriptions
257-task-board grep "TODO" -i --file README.md
258-
259-# With context lines
260-task-board grep "error" -C 2
261-```
