321-## Decision table
322-
323-| Need | Tool | Example |
324-|------|------|---------|
325:| Discover full API contract | DSL | `task-board q 'schema()'` |
326:| Repair one operation/mutation call | DSL | `task-board q 'schema(operation=NAME)'` / `schema(mutation=NAME)` |
327:| Preflight one spawn target | DSL | `task-board q 'project_config(view=spawn-preflight, role=ROLE, agent=PROVIDER)'` |
328:| Structured query (status, filter, lookup) | DSL query | `task-board q --format compact 'list(type=task, status=development) { overview }'` |
329-| Structured write (status, assign, link, create) | DSL mutation | `task-board m 'set_status(TASK-XX, status=development)'` |
330-| Evidence-backed producer handoff | CLI facade over shared mutation | `task-board handoff TASK-XX --role developer` |
331-| Board parent intent | CLI primary-goal group | `task-board goal get` / `task-board goal update --if-revision N ...` |
332-| Preview write without applying | DSL mutation | `task-board m --dry-run 'delete(TASK-XX)'` |
333-| Text search across elements | Grep | `task-board grep "AudioRecorder"` |
334:| **Phase planning (canonical API)** | **DSL query** | **`task-board q 'plan(EPIC-XX, mode=children)'`** |
335-| **Pretty-print / render / save a plan** | **CLI facade** | **`task-board plan EPIC-XX --render --format png`** |
336-| Resource management | DSL mutation / CLI | `task-board m 'add_resource(TASK-XX, name=TASK-XX_results.md, content="...", type=outcome)'` |
337-
338:**IMPORTANT:** Canonical planning lives in `task-board q 'plan(...)'`. Use `task-board plan` only as a local pretty-print / render / save facade over that same planning model. Never manually create phase breakdowns or write `.planning/` files from scratch.

