312:**Model validation:** Missing model, missing Codex/Qwen reasoning, reasoning on Claude, and known incompatible model/effort pairs block before board lookup or mutation. Unknown explicit models remain forward-compatible with a warning. Inspect the current compatibility matrix through local `models(agent=<selected-agent>)` even when the board itself is remote. Qwen model discovery also reports the Qwen Code context window and Token Plan Team seat pricing/monthly-quota applicability. Qwen ordinary children share the tracked prompt/process/run lifecycle, use a stream-JSON initialize frame to carry effort, and do not support goal-bound owner launches.
