316-**Prompt composition is board-centric:**
317-- task description comes from the element README
318-- task-specific DoD comes from checklist items already present on the element
319-- role baseline DoD is appended after task-specific DoD
320-- precondition resources carry additional instructions and artifacts
321-
322-Normal spawn does **not** require temp task briefs or temp DoD files. Hidden legacy `--task-path` and `--dod-path` flags are compatibility-only appenders; they are not the primary workflow and they do not replace board data as the source of truth.
