726-## Prerequisites
727-
728-### Claude (`claude -p`)
729-1. **Claude Code installed:** `which claude` → available in PATH
730-2. No git or trust requirements — works in any directory
731-
732-### Codex (`codex exec`)
733-1. **Codex CLI installed:** `which codex` → `/opt/homebrew/bin/codex` (or similar)
734-2. **Git repo:** `codex exec` requires a git repository. Will fail with `Not inside a trusted directory and --skip-git-repo-check was not specified` if not in a git repo
735-3. **Trust configured:** Project must be trusted in `~/.codex/config.toml` or use `--skip-git-repo-check`
736-4. **Model access:** Check which models work with your account type (see Failure Modes below)
