740-## Manual Launch (Fallback)
741-
742-Use manual launch only when `task-board spawn` is not available or you need custom control.
743-
744-### Step 1: Write prompts to files
745-
746-**CRITICAL:** Never pass prompts inline via heredoc + `&` background. The shell loses context. Always write prompts to files first.
747-
748-```bash
749-mkdir -p .temp/prompts
750-# Write each agent's prompt to a separate file
751-# .temp/prompts/codex-agent-name.md
752-```
753-
754-### Step 2: Launch via stdin redirect
755-
756-**Claude:**
757-```bash
758-claude -p \
759-  --output-format json \
760-  --model opus \
761-  --dangerously-skip-permissions \
762-  < .temp/prompts/claude-agent-name.md
763-```
764-
765-**Key claude flags:**
766-- `-p` — non-interactive "print" mode (reads prompt from stdin, no REPL)
767-- `--output-format json` — structured output
768-- `--model MODEL` — model to use (opus, sonnet, etc.)
769-- `--max-budget-usd N` — budget cap in USD
770-- `--dangerously-skip-permissions` — no approval prompts
771-
772-**Codex:**
773-```bash
774-codex exec \
775-  -m gpt-5.6-sol \
776-  -c 'model_reasoning_effort="max"' \
777-  --dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox \
778-  --skip-git-repo-check \
779-  -C /path/to/project \
780-  - < .temp/prompts/codex-agent-name.md \
781-  > .temp/codex-agent-name.log 2>&1 &
782-echo "PID: $!"
783-```
784-
785-**Key codex flags:**
786-- `-m MODEL` — explicit model (inspect `task-board q --format compact 'models(agent=codex)'`)
787-- `-c 'model_reasoning_effort="EFFORT"'` — explicit model-compatible effort; `xhigh` is Extra high, `max` is the highest recommended board-managed level, and `ultra` remains an explicit compatible delegation choice on supported models
788-- `--dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox` — run non-interactively without Codex sandbox so spawned agents can spawn further tracked children
789-- `--skip-git-repo-check` — bypass trust check when the project is intentionally outside a normal git checkout
790-- `-C DIR` — working directory (must be the project root)
791-- `- < file.md` — read prompt from stdin (the `-` is required!)
792-- `> .temp/log 2>&1 &` — background with log capture
793-
794-Codex CLI 0.142.0 no longer accepts the old `-a never` shorthand on
795-`codex exec`; use `--dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox` for automation.
796-
797-### Step 3: Verify within 30 seconds
798-
799-```bash
800-# Check logs are growing
801-sleep 30 && wc -c .temp/codex-*.log
802-
803-# Check task-board updates
804-task-board q --format compact 'agents()'
805-```
806-
807-If logs are 0 bytes or not growing → agent is dead. See Failure Modes.
