- `make validate` with the task venv: pass — 42 schemas, 422 vector files, 44 Python tests, Go tool tests.
- Focused `AdditionalDriverBoundaryTests`: 15/15 pass.
- `go vet ./tools/...`, Go formatting check, and scoped `git diff --check`: pass.
